[statement]
A name required from outside the package installed for its condition is
unaffected by the condition's `!` entry: `top` needs `docs` and `base`,
`e`, with the condition `base` and `!docs<1`, needs `docs`, and apk
installs all four
(`a-condition-s-negated-entry-keeps-its-name-out-of-the-package-s-dependencies`).

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:base docs

P:base
V:1

P:docs
V:1

P:e
V:1
D:docs
i:base !docs<1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install docs 1
install e 1
install top 1
